      "description": "Collection path, existing tool title, and frontmatter description.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-page-opening\"><nav class=\"ds-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/#cheatsheets\">Cheatsheets</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">git</span></nav><h1>git</h1><p>Config, commit, log, push, worktree, patch, diff, show, pipelines, and stacked rebase.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-page-opening{padding:2rem 0 .6rem}.ds-breadcrumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;color:var(--atlas-blue);font:600 .7rem/1.5 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-breadcrumb a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-breadcrumb a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-breadcrumb a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--atlas-blue);outline-offset:3px}.ds-page-opening h1{margin:1.45rem 0 0;color:var(--atlas-ink);font:600 clamp(3.5rem,5.5vw,5rem)/1.05 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.035em}.ds-page-opening p{max-width:65ch;margin:.9rem 0 0;color:var(--atlas-text);font:400 1.04rem/1.6 var(--font-sans)}@media(max-width:49.999rem){.ds-page-opening h1{font-size:clamp(3.25rem,10vw,4.25rem)}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Terminal example",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "code-frame",
      "description": "Labeled command frame with neutral code, cobalt first token, and hard offset.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-terminal\"><div class=\"ds-terminal-head\"><span>TERMINAL EXAMPLE</span><button type=\"button\">COPY</button></div><pre><code><span class=\"ds-command\">git</span> status --short</code></pre></div>",
      "css": ".ds-terminal{border:1px solid var(--atlas-line);border-radius:0;background:var(--atlas-paper);box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--atlas-active)}.ds-terminal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:.25rem .9rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--atlas-line);color:var(--atlas-muted);font:400 .65rem/1.5 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.04em}.ds-terminal-head button{min-width:2.9rem;min-height:1.7rem;border:0;color:var(--atlas-muted);background:transparent;font:400 .65rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.04em;cursor:pointer}.ds-terminal-head button:hover{color:var(--atlas-blue)}.ds-terminal-head button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--atlas-blue);outline-offset:3px}.ds-terminal pre{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow-x:auto;color:var(--atlas-ink);font:400 .82rem/1.65 var(--font-mono)}.ds-command{color:var(--atlas-blue)}"
    }
